# Shell scripts must keep LF on every platform, including a Windows checkout
# with core.autocrlf=true; a CRLF shebang line fails with "bad interpreter".
*.sh text eol=lf

# Python, Markdown and JSON are read by tools that tolerate either, but keeping
# them LF avoids whole-file diffs when a contributor's editor disagrees.
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
